  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Open Comparison Desk",
    "overview": "Accelerate pairs open editorial space with a practical car-shopping workspace. The approved Aerotime reference supplies the light, restrained rhythm; the implementation adapts that direction to real listing import, comparison and evidence. Deep indigo text and compact blue actions sit on near-white and pale fields.\n\nThe name itself is the identity: a slanted typographic wordmark, with no separate logo or symbol. Self-hosted Clash Grotesk headings and Satoshi interface text preserve continuity while flat surfaces, contained photographs and explicit source labels make the product approachable and useful.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Light editorial fields with deep indigo reading text and a clear action hierarchy.",
      "Self-hosted Clash Grotesk headings, Satoshi controls and a slanted Accelerate wordmark.",
      "Flat tonal grouping, restrained borders and gently curved controls.",
      "Contained car photography, manual preview controls and visible evidence."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
